DONE stage=F find=8 open=2 tok~=620
ANSWER Q1: direct path scoped to daemon-initiated agent-to-agent handoff/collaboration only. Human<->agent hub chat always stays hub-relayed (matches F1 fix=scope-direct-path-to-daemon-collab-hub-notified-async).
ANSWER Q2: opt-in per daemon config, default OFF. A daemon must explicitly enable the LAN listener; hub can still push a kill-switch/disable nudge (same pattern as agent_capabilities_refresh) regardless.
